about what you feel, or even a sense of gratitude. Hitbodedut does not have to be orderly or planned in advance. It is a place to release what is in your heart and to turn towards the bond with Hashem." resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_body" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[89,406][991,465]" /></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.LinearLayout" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,544][1038,1231]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.LinearLayout" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[89,591][991,775]"><node index="0" text="4" resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_number" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[89,638][178,727]" /><node index="1" text="Put the devices away" resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_title" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[210,652][807,713]" /><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.FrameLayout" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[833,591][991,775]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_art" class="android.widget.ImageView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[844,602][980,764]" /></node></node><node index="1" text="If you want to feel truly alone with yourself, avoid devices entirely during hitbodedut. Turn the phone off, or leave it in another room. The freer you are of outside distraction, the better you will connect to yourself and to the Creator. Cutting off from the outside world helps you concentrate and settle into the quiet within." resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_body" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[89,807][991,1184]" /></node><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.LinearLayout" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1263][1038,1950]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.LinearLayout" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[89,1310][991,1494]"><node index="0" text="5" resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_number" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[89,1357][178,1446]" /><node index="1" text="Start with Tehilim, or your own words" resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_title" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[210,1345][807,1459]" /><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.FrameLayout" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[833,1310][991,1494]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_art" class="android.widget.ImageView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[844,1321][980,1483]" /></node></node><node index="1" text="If you are not sure how to begin, open Tehilim and read a few chapters. The Psalms are prayer already formed, very direct, and they touch the soul. In hitbodedut they can be a spiritual thread leading you straight to Hashem. And if you feel you have no words, you can simply speak with Hashem freely, sharing your thoughts and what you feel." resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_body" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[89,1526][991,1903]" /></node><node index="3" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.LinearLayout" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1982][1038,2337]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.LinearLayout" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[89,2029][991,2213]"><node index="0" text="6" resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_number" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[89,2076][178,2165]" /><node index="1" text="Ask yourself inward questions" resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_title" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[210,2064][807,2178]" /><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.FrameLayout" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[833,2029][991,2213]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_art" class="android.widget.ImageView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[844,2040][980,2202]" /></node></node><node index="1" text="During hitbodedut, ask yourself inward questions. What am I feeling right now? What am I going through? How can I feel closer to Hashem? What do I need to improve in my life? This is a time for a real cheshbon nefesh. Sometimes, in the inner quiet, you come to see your real needs and the right direction for your life." resource-id="com.myhitbodedut:id/tip_body" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[89,2245][991,2337]" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="android:id/statusBarBackground" class="android.view.View" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][1080,128]" /><node index="2" text="" resource-id="android:id/navigationBarBackground" class="android.view.View" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,2337][1080,2400]" /></node></hierarchy>